,"version":5},{"id":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","dayOffset":67,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Closing","description":"","color":"#6366f1","position":0,"createdAt":1793144687136,"version":4},{"id":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","dayOffset":113816,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Owing","description":"","color":"#34d399","position":1,"createdAt":1793144795781,"version":5}],"chapters":[{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":19,"title":"Quit-Claim","synopsis":"At the mouth of the Throat, Dagny learns what Teodor's key really does, and chooses who Lantern will owe.","id":"1MW5Jge-H8rXVD55LzbJB","createdAt":1793144794665,"updatedAt":1793144794665,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":4,"title":"The Paired Keys","synopsis":"The Speakers put their demand to the Director and are refused. The comptroller who built the Tally tells Dagny there is a master key, and that it takes two.","id":"1mLWBC3drPbUeBuQy0FoX","createdAt":1793144788148,"updatedAt":1793144788148,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":6,"title":"The Throat","synopsis":"The race through the healing Throat. A rival ship dies in its lips. On the far side, the Sabra system is silent on every band.","id":"2Kh0EVXk-CjNvPK63bVhr","createdAt":1793144835013,"updatedAt":1793144835013,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":5,"title":"The Counter","synopsis":"A junior counter audits the Hask family for the Calling, finds the arithmetic wrong, and pulls the root of the Caul Account. Nobody holds it.","id":"3cwRgmDvjXK0JC6cuy4tY","createdAt":1793144823013,"updatedAt":1793144823013,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":21,"title":"The Names","synopsis":"Lantern comes out of eclipse. Nine hundred names, and a bell to ring for each.","id":"3gv96eDpK0doTU0ZB7JCo","createdAt":1793144841529,"updatedAt":1793144841529,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":11,"title":"Hull 7731","synopsis":"Orrin finds what Hull 7731 is. There is fuel, and the Count is keeping it. The first of the Called go into the cold.","id":"9aMzXwU26-kt3cR5nC-U4","createdAt":1793144825613,"updatedAt":1793147121473,"version":3},{"notes":"Kas says \"nine hundred on a shift\" and Teodor's file reads nine hundred: the only two hints at Caul before ch10. Keep them that quiet.","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":1,"title":"Air on Credit","synopsis":"A Wick-tender watches a man suffocate in a pressure lock because his balance ran out. The bell is rung. The Director announces the Throat will close in fifty-two days, and the indentured will stay.","id":"APRN5Ai8vKuZi7avjEG2x","createdAt":1793144687141,"updatedAt":1793145410788,"version":5},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":3,"title":"Provenance","synopsis":"At Port Ambry, where the Throat is healing, a bonded lien adjuster takes the job of collecting a seven-hundred-year-old debt. An archivist comes aboard with a bell covered in names.","id":"AqG5mFoTr2Pk939QIPRvQ","createdAt":1793144833696,"updatedAt":1793144833696,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":8,"title":"The Salt","synopsis":"Tamsin sells her hatch to the smugglers of the Salt and cuts it open. Inside: empty fuel racks, a manifest pointing to C-V, and names scratched in the dark.","id":"HDdL_ZxEKaitmru4YBzmU","createdAt":1793144824313,"updatedAt":1793144824313,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":12,"title":"The Hold","synopsis":"Fen breaks the throat-watch logs and finds nine hundred people who never arrived anywhere. Corvin opens the hold.","id":"K0CWXqGiSVJkflrWhfMhD","createdAt":1793144837613,"updatedAt":1793144837613,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":16,"title":"The Sale","synopsis":"The boarding of the Covenant is betrayed. Kas has sold the plan for two seats out.","id":"Qi1y2UB2l4ekV7FhtSWGo","createdAt":1793144793364,"updatedAt":1793144793364,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":18,"title":"Lien","synopsis":"Haste takes the ship. The captain dies. Corvin signs. On the bell's crown, words in another hand.","id":"QrN11_5DFiyFv_3faW44U","createdAt":1793144840213,"updatedAt":1793144840213,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":13,"title":"In Trust","synopsis":"Varga tells Dagny the Concord will not save them. Pim is dimmed. Odile engraves the dead of Caul. Dagny makes a new plan, and tells her brother.","id":"SF8tOubtPZvFrBVTjoVrR","createdAt":1793144792064,"updatedAt":1793144792064,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":10,"title":"The Shear","synopsis":"Teodor confesses Caul Deep. Kas flies Dagny to the sealed shaft. The Throat was never closing: the Company is closing it.","id":"Tcx46VR8E3-0Yl7l4nEsj","createdAt":1793144790765,"updatedAt":1793144790765,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":20,"title":"The Wick","synopsis":"The Called climb out of the cold and into the Hulk. Its name is still on its bridge.","id":"Vgnqq6wAe9CnM6uwe0cLv","createdAt":1793144829513,"updatedAt":1793144829513,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"TAAHx64wy6zcrgc0s_FVP","number":7,"title":"Strike","synopsis":"The Wick crews dim the lamp. Security storms the spine and a man dies. Teodor brings Dagny the shape of the keys, and Odile asks for more bell.","id":"XQZwAfQA1gtIFkYZqNKyw","createdAt":1793144789448,"updatedAt":1793144789448,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":2,"title":"The Ghost Bell","synopsis":"Three centuries on, a cutter in the frozen Cold Wards finds a Company hatch. At home her mother coughs; the neighbours strike an empty bell hook for their dead. The Count proclaims the Calling.","id":"ddbkVvh0hPVMCNJMkEFYz","createdAt":1793144821697,"updatedAt":1793144821697,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":9,"title":"Dead Air","synopsis":"The Good Title finds the Company's dead throat-watch station. Haste explains what a lien attaches to. Something in the system is still counting.","id":"hXVlllW9-KUNOLinlW78k","createdAt":1793144836313,"updatedAt":1793144836313,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"-ZiYa6rM8LYD4CUNIG4--","number":15,"title":"The Far Side of Nhai","synopsis":"The bailiffs drill for consolidation. A sleeper dies in her pod. Haste seizes the bell as an asset of the Sabra Concern.","id":"lxDLW8gJeCpt1SBZcTHJv","createdAt":1793144838913,"updatedAt":1793144838913,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","timelineId":"bqr_Pql5DzQd25cWbMJih","number":14,"title":"The Wickwright","synopsis":"The last keeper of the lamp says it can be relit. Agathe's name goes on the list. The Salt names its price.","id":"rpwZrYK23uMW6acxfL-GH","createdAt":1793144826913,"updatedAt":1793144826913,"version":1},{"notes":"","wordGoal":null,"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","t